# Architecture Overview – Change Lite

## Application Scope
- Scoped application built using ServiceNow Studio
- Extends OOB Change Request table safely

## Data Model
- change_request (extended)
  - u_risk_score (Integer)
  - u_major_change (Boolean)
  - u_emergency_justification (String)

## Core Flow
1. Change created or updated
2. Risk score calculated via Script Include
3. Risk level derived (Low / Moderate / High)
4. CAB approval flow triggered when required
5. Emergency changes bypass approval
6. Blackout schedule validated before save
7. Incident-linked changes created via UI Action

## Design Principles
- Minimal OOB modification
- Modular server-side logic
- Modern Flow Designer usage
- Clear separation of concerns
